ing/unattempted args=[12039,3] at 2026-08-11 23:01:52Z / D10 05:01:52 site | k=18112 | prior sent-for marker=2026-08-07 18:00:00Z|3 | D10 verifies the persisted task-specific renews-soon mail and no duplicate; never force.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>D10 WQ REMINDER HANDOFF | captured %s UTC+6 / %sZ | D10_WQ_REM_PRE=%s | SUB_WQ=12749 active, parent=12748, customer=365, product=12737, payments=2, next=2026-08-14 18:00:00Z | reminder action 15849 pending/unattempted args=[12749,3] at 2026-08-11 23:19:30Z / D10 05:19:30 site | k=19170 | no prior sent-for marker | D10 verifies the persisted task-specific renews-soon mail and no duplicate; never force.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->' "$SLT_SITE_AFTER" "$SLT_UTC_AFTER" "$SLT_CURSOR" "$SLT_SITE_AFTER" "$SLT_UTC_AFTER" "$SLT_CURSOR" "$SLT_SITE_AFTER" "$SLT_UTC_AFTER" "$SLT_CURSOR" "$SLT_SITE_AFTER" "$SLT_UTC_AFTER" "$SLT_CURSOR" "$SLT_SITE_AFTER" "$SLT_UTC_AFTER" "$SLT_CURSOR"
