+printf -v SLT_REGISTRY_BLOCK '\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SLT-SYN-09 D09 PRE / D10 NATURAL HANDOFF | captured %s UTC+6 / %sZ | SYN09_2SEG_D10_PRE=%s | SUB_2SEG=12172 active, parent=12162, customer=354, product=12099, payments=3, next=2026-08-11 18:00:00Z | pending relationship order=13788, wc-pending, USD 9.00, cycle=4, scheduled_date=2026-08-11 18:00:00Z, reverse refs=12172 | invoice action 16166 complete; natural charge action 16167 pending/unattempted args=[12172] at 2026-08-11 18:11:39Z / D10 00:11:39 site | k=699 | D10 verifies persisted action/order/mail/grid evidence; never force.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>D10 NC NATURAL HANDOFF | captured %s UTC+6 / %sZ | D10_NC_PRE=%s | SUB_NC=12193 active, parent=12183, customer=355, product=12102, payments=2, next=2026-08-11 18:00:00Z | pending relationship order=13805, wc-pending, USD 9.00, cycle=3, scheduled_date=2026-08-11 18:00:00Z, reverse refs=12193 | invoice action 16176 complete; natural charge action 16177 pending/unattempted args=[12193] at 2026-08-11 18:40:35Z / D10 00:40:35 site | k=2435 | D10 verifies persisted action/order/mail evidence; never force.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>D10 CORE2 NATURAL HANDOFF | captured %s UTC+6 / %sZ | D10_CORE2_PRE=%s | SUB_CORE_CLASSIC=11991 active, parent=11990, customer=357, product=11927, payments=9, next=2026-08-11 13:23:13Z | pending relationship order=13808, wc-pending, USD 10.00, cycle=10, scheduled_date=2026-08-11 13:23:13Z, reverse refs=11991 | invoice action 16929 complete; natural charge action 16930 pending/unattempted args=[11991] at 2026-08-11 19:04:26Z / D10 01:04:26 site | k=20473 | D10 verifies persisted action/order/mail evidence; never force.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>D10 W1 REMINDER HANDOFF | captured %s UTC+6 / %sZ | D10_W1_REM_PRE=%s | SUB_W1=12039 active, parent=12029, customer=350, product=11943, payments=2, next=2026-08-14 18:00:00Z | reminder action 15838 pend